<title>AUSTRALIA: Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - July 10.</title>
<headline>Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - July 10.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>				  Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		     Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   Consol Rutile	 195.18    0.83</p>
<p> 2   Mt Leyshon Gold	15.63    1.60</p>
<p> 3   Natl Consol	     9.47    0.95</p>
<p> 4   Aust Tour		 9.38    0.80</p>
<p> 5   Prime Credit Tr	 9.27    1.05</p>
<p> 6   Cudgen R.Z.	     9.12    2.74</p>
<p> 7   Prop Income Inv	 8.85    1.14</p>
<p> 8   BT Prop Trust	   8.59    1.90</p>
<p> 9   Indu Property	   8.58    0.99</p>
<p>10   Centro Prop	     8.30    2.32</p>
<p>11   Countrywide-PP	  8.26    1.23</p>
<p>12   Davids Limited	  8.26    1.21</p>
<p>13   Colonial Mutual	 8.14    1.31</p>
<p>14   Sea World Prop	  8.10    1.47</p>
<p>15   Ipoh			7.89    2.28</p>
